  "question": {
    "text": "The tangent at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> to the curve, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> does not pass through the point:"
